sics-based movement with GorillaLocomotion\nIn-game economy with a wallet system\nItem spawning and collecting\nVending machines to spend your earnings\nCross-session progress saved to the cloud\n\nHow to Play\nPut on your Meta Quest headset\nLaunch Animal Company Simulator\nLog in with your Meta account\nJoin a public room or create a private one with friends\nMove around using your hands and body\nCollect items, earn money, and spend it at vending machines\n", "short_description": "Animal Company Simulator\nA multiplayer VR game for Meta Quest\nAnimal Company Simulator is a fun, physics-based VR game where you run, climb, and interact in a shared world with other players. Buy items, explore, and cause chaos with friends.\n\nAbout the Game\nAnimal Company Simulator is built for Meta Quest using GorillaLocomotion, giving players a natural and immersive movement experience. Play with up to 10 players in the same world, purchase items from vending machines, and collect rewards scat"}]}, "developer_name": "Thunda", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/h4kcompany/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ISY TAG", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/h4kcompany/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26227314510236247"}, "review_messages":