_2.png", "id": "816382394825297", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_816382398158630_2247166108219462516_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=612l6Owp-OUQ7kNvwHHLGmv&_nc_oc=AdoAIqETQ0FdXZuZ0RjBUGRryY97OibcaKoFBun017ArtBLnW4BFb4KXF50aaZ9PIwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af56V5uEH2jMxxJb2Hz2LJlhPheXgVw6lXYpiDxXM7mZAg&oe=6A19893F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Animal Company Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Here's the updated text:\n\nAnimal Company Simulator\nA multiplayer VR game for Meta Quest\nAnimal Company Simulator is a fun, physics-based VR game where you run, climb, and interact in a shared world with other players. Buy items, explore, and cause chaos with friends.\n\nAbout the Game\nAnimal Company Simulator is built for Meta Quest using GorillaLocomotion, giving players a natural and immersive movement experience. Play with up to 10 players in the same world, purchase items from vending machines, and collect rewards scattered around the map.\n\nFeatures\nMultiplayer \u2014 up to 10 players per room\nPhysics-based movement with GorillaLocomotion\nIn-game economy with a wallet system\nItem spawning and collecting\nVending machines to spend your earnings\nCross-session progress saved to the cloud\n\nHow to Play\nPut on your Meta Quest headset\nLaunch Animal Company Simulator\nLog in with your Meta account\nJoin a public room or create a private one with friends\nMove around using your hands and body\nCollect items, earn money, and spend it at vending machines\n", "short_description": "Animal Company Simulator\nA multiplayer VR game for Meta Quest\nAnimal Company Simulator is a fun, physics-based VR game where you run, climb, and interact in a shared world with other players. Buy items, explore, and cause chaos with friends.\n\nAbout the Game\nAnimal Company Simulator is built for Meta Quest using GorillaLocomotion, givi